#user_input
Tutor: What time do you have lunch?
#objective: At twelve
#chunks: I have lunch at twelve.,I work from nine to five.
#user_input
Tutor: Do you eat lunch at the office?
#objective: Yes you do
#chunks: I have lunch at twelve.,I work in an office.
#user_input
Tutor: What time do you finish work?
#objective: At five — go home by bus
#chunks: I work from nine to five.,I go to work by bus.
#user_input
Tutor: I finish at five and go home by bus.
#objective: Complete the daytime description
